# Caption file format (Section 6.7) — one caption per line.
# start_seconds | script_text | key_text
#
# script_text: 1..2 words, rendered in the calligraphic script layer.
#              First letter becomes the decorative initial.
# key_text:    exactly one word, rendered ALL CAPS in the bold condensed layer.
# start_seconds: time (s) of the sung line; the planner snaps it to the shot
#              that contains it (within the config snap tolerance).
#
# DO NOT put copyrighted lyrics here unless you hold the rights (Section 1.3).
# The example below is generic placeholder text you own.
00.00 | Stay with | ME
01.90 | Every | NIGHT
03.80 | Hold me | CLOSE
05.70 | Never | GO
07.60 | In your | EYES
09.50 | Feel the | LIGHT
11.40 | Dance with | ME
13.30 | All night | LONG
15.20 | You and | I
17.10 | Forever | YOURS
22.70 | Come back | HOME
24.60 | Stay with | ME
